#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""spark-update-check -- weekly REPORT-ONLY update/security checker for Walter.

Never pulls, upgrades or restarts anything. It reads the current pins from
the compose/config files, asks GitHub (releases + security advisories) and the
container registries (tag -> digest) what is current upstream, inspects apt
and the NVIDIA driver, and writes a Markdown report.

  report : /var/lib/spark-update-check/report-YYYY-mm-dd.md (+ latest.md symlink)
  exit   : 0 OK, 10 updates available, 20 security advisories affect current
           versions, 1 internal error
  token  : optional GitHub token in /etc/spark-update-check/github-token
           (never printed; only sent to api.github.com)

python3 stdlib only.
"""

